{"id":"lenguaje","lemma":"lenguaje","pos":"noun","rank":2064,"glosses":["language (the ability to communicate using words)","language (a body of words, and set of methods of combining them, understood by a community)","language (the expression of thought (the communication of meaning) in a specified way)"],"ipa":"/lenˈɡwaxe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"lenguajes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-lenguaje.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuántos lenguajes hablas tú?","en":"How many languages do you speak?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734298","words":[{"g":"how much","l":"cuánto"},null,{"g":"speech","l":"habla"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"La música es el lenguaje universal.","en":"Music is the universal language.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35376","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"music"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"universal"}]},{"text":"Hablamos en lenguaje de señas.","en":"We talked in sign language.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582501","words":[{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sign, indication","l":"seña"}]},{"text":"¿Conoces el lenguaje de signos?","en":"Are you familiar with sign language?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sign, indication","l":"signo"}]},{"text":"El lenguaje puede ser usado de muchas formas.","en":"Language can be used in many ways.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77968","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"worn, worn-out"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"shape","l":"forma"}]}]}